# One supervised cartesian move (mm / degrees, robot base frame).
# Used by the task manager's calibration grid loop; also useful for jogging.
# Cancel policy: a single move runs to completion (the pybind layer has no
# mid-motion stop) — a cancel marks the goal canceled once the move settles.
float64 x
float64 y
float64 z
float64 rx
float64 ry
float64 rz
---
bool success
string message
---
